OL,4,CNew boss appointed to lead Travelodge  
OL,5,GTravelodge has appointed a former Tui  
OL,6,Gexecutive to become its new boss from  
OL,7,Gthe start of December.                 
OL,9,FThe former CEO of the Oxfordshire-     
OL,10,Fbased budget hotel chain Jo Boydell    
OL,11,Fquit in the summer after safety issues 
OL,12,Fwere raised at many of its sites.      
OL,14,FA woman staying at its Maidenhead      
OL,15,Fhotel was sexually assaulted in        
OL,16,FDecember 2022 after a man lied to      
OL,17,Fstaff to get a key card to her room.   
OL,18,FKyran Smith was jailed for seven-and-a-
OL,19,Fhalf years for the attack.             
